<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">BaFisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaFs</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaFisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aFisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">BaFisa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aFisa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni bɔk aBulus, atom Anet-Isheshek aYeso ni ishim Adakunom, sak ne bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se ne Afisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afumung akak afɛ́ ashon da a bɛ </char><char style="fqa">fɛ́ ba se ne Afisa</char> awo.</note>, bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi nyeseng tsìk ni kuus Anet-Isheshek aYeso:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Won itek, ni kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom, nɛ aTisa aYeso Kristi, ni ku sot gung ni yin.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awɛng abik fɛ́ ba sɛs <optbreak /> ne Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Itere ni i yet ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ada aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a mi ki te yit awɛng, ne akaakyi kuri awɛng abik fɛ́ a se naton aza, nek kusot yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Nek iwu mang ki kasa yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek dang na nye kazatse, nɔng in da sot yit jɛrɛ, vit inɛn anu ashon wu. Nek ishim wu, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Adakunom mang sak gyam, ni in sot yit nnon wu nek ikyɛng fɛ́ aYeso Kristi nye. Anɔng e se kpaf ni ikyɛng fi iwu shim.<verse eid="EPH 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />A nye anɔng, nek in di tere yit ízɔk itek wu, fɛ́ a ki nɔɔk yit ninang, ayɛt Ari wu fɛ́ a shim. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ni wu ba mi ki bisik yit nek inosong nasok wu, in sɛ yit ifuut anɛn, kpaf ni kurúm itek fɛ́ Adakunom bɛ̀, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />fɛ́ a mi ki nɔɔk yit shɛrɛk, ngma ni kutsitsɛng makiyi ni irēn nkyɔrɔk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik, itonong fok Adakunom nesek itek wu nek kutsitsɛng ni irēn wu ke nek kutsitsɛng wu ni irēn wu a ki nɔɔk yit itek wu.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Nek iwu shim nin rēn yit, Adakunom mi ki tonong yit kushim wu fi ku tsang se ni nɛt, kuyɔng fi ku mi sɛ ishining ayɛt Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom mi sak e, bi shining ni izen fi i se kpaf: a bi moon ngma nkyɔrɔk fi i se azanɛn, ni nyɔng fi in sɛ azatse, ni ice anet azining, fɛ́ ayet Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ayɛt wu fɛ̀ Adakunom ki kasa yit mo, ni in sot yit banet ice wu. A ki myak yit gyam nek anɔng fɛ́ a kin sak, na a nye kaakyi ikyɛng ni tseng kpaf ni kushim wu, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />nɔng iyit fi in yet yit bafi imɛsɛng ayɛt ite iyɛ na Kristi, in da sot yit bafi itere ízɔk Adakunom. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Iyin se yin ayɛt Anet-Isheshek bà, nek izen fi i kin fok yin ifɛ̀ atsak, ifɛ̀ itek fi i nesek isheshek, ama fi i di nɔɔk yin atsak, ba ki te yin izizɔ nagang wu, Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ́ ba kin nye kushii me. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Kabik aJɛrɛ me yet ikyɛng fin tsin tin bamang yit, nfi ngma iya itekari fɛ́ Adakunom mi ki nɔɔk yit fɛ́ a tonoso gbing-gbing fok in bi ya yit ide, ma izen fɛ́ Adakunom bi bisik ngma nnon wu, sak itere ízɔk wu.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inesek ifeng nɛ awon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Nek anɔng, nkum izen fi imi kin fok inɔɔk atsak yin na aTisa aYeso, ni ishim fi iyin bɛ̀ yin sak na banet Adakunom ngma, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />in mi won inesek ifeng nek iyin awo, ni in yiring ni iyin ayɛt awon hom, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />in woso ra awon fok Adakunom aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, Ada Azɔk-Bazɔk, ki nɔɔk yin kutsitsɛng abik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kabik aJɛrɛ ayi.</char></note> ni itarak ice abik, nɔng i da ku rēn yin mo yɛɛt-yɛɛt.<verse eid="EPH 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />In ras awon fok, Adakunom na ki tarak yin ayisi iyɛ yin, nɔng i da bin rēn yin ite iyɛ fɛ́ ba ki yes yin nek iye, i da rēn yin kurúm ízɔk iya itekari fɛ́ ba mi sak nek banet Adakunom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Banet Adakunom yet iya itekari Adakunom ayi.</char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />ni rēn yin kugap wu fi ku got agap imara fi ku se ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak. Kukyem e yɔng yet kuzining ni kugap e <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />fɛ́ Adakunom kin di ra kutomong na Anet-Isheshek ni izen idonong wu ni irɛk, a ku nɔk karɔ isonong ni bɔk iyak wu azanɛn, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />kashon hwyeng-hwyeng ne bágwɔm ngma nɛ bafi kukyem nɛ bafɛ́ agap nɛ bátisa. Iyerek fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek bɛ̀, se kashon na akaakyi iyerek fɛ́ ba nesek, da nkum ni kuzam ku kang kyɛk awo, ngma ni kuyɔng fi ku bi bɛ́. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Adakunom mi sak kaakyɛ na átas atak wu, a mi ku sak na a sot ice naton kaakyɛ nek ngma bafi ikuus, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />fɛ́ a yet kurɔm wu, ishining wu, fɛ́ a shining kaakyɛ ngma kusum.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kutset kufas ayɛt <optbreak /> Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Iyin kin tsang kus yin ayɛt iras nkyɔrɔk nduk e nɛ anɛn yin, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />fi i kin tsang di sot yin yame, ni izen fi i tsang kuus yin nggɔn azatse kang, na agwɔm yɔng fɛ́ a ya igwɔm naton itseng azatse, kabik fɛ́ ka se ni kutomong yɔkɔnɔng ayɛt ayɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras iduk e. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Ngma yit in kin se yit ti iba yaame, in ras yit nkyɔrɔk fi nrɔm na ayɛ anɛn yit tsɛsɛk, nek nse kusot anɛn yit, i se gbing ni in nyim yit ne kafa kawe Adakunom kpaf ti ishɛrɛp banet.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Awɛt nek kudot ishim fɛ́ Adakunom bɛ̀ nek iyit, nɛ kurúm angmishish wu, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />a ki nɔɔk yit kutset nɛ Anet-Isheshek, ngma fi in tsang kus yit ayɛt idun yit, ayet nek itek de fɛ́ ba ki sheshek yin mo. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Nek kusot yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, Adakunom ki donong yit gung ni wu, a ki nɔk yit karɔ isonong ni wu azɔng azanɛn, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />nɔng ni kuzam fi ku bi bɛ́, a bi di tonong kurúm itek wu, ni irèn ishim fɛ́ a tonong ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Nek ni itek de fi i di sɛ yin isheshek, ni inɔɔk atsak, a yet nek fi iyin awo, a yet kunang Adakunom, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />a yet nek kutomong ikikak awo, kɔng akak bi tsot kugwɔm. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Nek iyit yet yit kutomong ibɔk Adakunom, a ki nye yit ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso nek in ras yit ntomong ntek, nyɔng fɛ́ Adakunom man sak in di ras yit kutomong.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bazining <optbreak /> ayɛt Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Nek anɔng, yiring yin fok iyin yet yin Ícɛn-iduk ni kutes, bayɔng fɛ́ baYahuda &lt;&lt;bafɛ́ katse&gt;&gt; ki yes yin, &lt;&lt;bafɛ́ avit katse&gt;&gt;, fi mbɔk banet ras kurɔm e. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Yiring yin fok ni izen e yɔng, iyin kin se yin atsitse na Anet-Isheshek, vit ayɔng fɛ́ a ki fa yin ti nnon mben aIsrela, i kin yet yin batsen ayɛt irosom kushi fɛ́ Adakunom man nye, vit iyin ni ite iyɛ, vit iyin na Adakunom azatse kang. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Awɛt kyɔrɔng fi i se yin ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, iyin fi i tsang se yin yik-yik, ba mi bɛ́ ni iyin bakat nek nasok Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Nek iwu ice wu yet kukyang yit, iwu fɛ́ a mi sak bafaa me sot azining, a mi yirik kubat, ni ikyɛng yɔng fi i kaba yit, fi ibɛ́s ni ifà, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />ni kurɔm wu, a di tun agap ntsi nɛ agbat ifɛ̀ ni nkyɔrɔk in se gbing na ba ras. A nye anɔng, nek a di nok banet bafaa me na ba sot anet azining afas, na anɔng kukyang di sɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Ni kurɔm kuzining e, a di bɛ ni inosong-ashi nek banet bafaa me sak na Adakunom ayɛt iku wu ni ikum, a di fɛt ifà me. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />A bɛ́ a ki shara yin kusot kukyang, iyin fi i tsang se yin yik-yik, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se bakat. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Na Anet-Isheshek, baYahuda nɛ Ícɛn-iduk in di sɛ yit irèn sak na Ada ni irèn Kabik kazining e.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Nek anɔng, yɔkɔnɔng, iyin ti i yet yin batsen nɛ bafɛ́ amatse awo, tit nnon mben gung nɛ banet Adakunom, bafɛ́ ari Adakunom, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />bayɔng fɛ́ ba nok iba azaton itis fɛ́ batom-aYeso nɛ batan ta, fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek aYeso ice wu yet kuta itsok itu kutek ayɛt inok e. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Naton wu wu fi inok e ngma kusum kana moon mo, i di rasak sak isot kutu ajɛrɛ fɛ́ ba mi sak nek aTisa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Ni kusot fi i se yin ayɛt wu, ba tsin ki nok yin mok ni isot yin karɔ fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom dí sosok.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">ABulus anet ishara ifɛ̀ <optbreak /> sak ni Ícɛn-iduk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Nek anɔng imi aBulus, afi inyang nek Anet-Isheshek aYeso, akuce yin bafi Ícɛn-iduk <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />imi rēn fok iyin mi fok yin itek fɛ́ Adakunom di nɔk, nek ira kutomong nek iyin. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Ikyɛng inɛt fɛ́ ba di tonong e na nabos e, se kpaf ni ikyɛng fi in mi ki shɛbɛk yin e ni ijɛk. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Ni izen fi iyin fa yin ide, na anɔng fi iyin da rēn yin kutsik irēn hom ayɛt ikyɛng inɛt Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Idɔng fɛ́ ba kin won dang tonong bafi nzam fi in mi gosok, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ Kabik Adakunom mi tonong batom ajɛrɛ nɛ batan wu ne. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Ikyɛng inɛt e yet fok, ayɛt ishara ifɛ̀ itek, bafi Ícɛn-iduk yet bafi iya itekari gung nɛ bafi aIsrela, ba yet nkap kurɔm kuzining ngma bá, ba bɛ̀ kanu kafuba ayɛt ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom mang nye kushi me, ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Imi sot afi ishara ifɛ̀ itek e deng, nek kunang itek fɛ́ Adakunom di nɔk, ayɛt kukyem wu fi ku tsin ra kutomong ni imi. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ngma fi imi wu fi in dung rat ayɛt banet Adakunom, ngma na anɔng, ba di nɔk itek e deng: nɔng in di shara sak ni Ícɛn-iduk, itek fi i wat agap kuyiring yit, in mi sɛ yit ide na Anet-Isheshek, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />ni in nɔɔk kaangan mgbey azaton ikyɛng inɛt e, fɛ́ Adakunom kin fam ide na ayɛ ama, iwu fɛ́ a nye kaakyi ikyɛng. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Kushim wu yet fok yɔkɔnɔng, bafi ikuus ba fɛ̀ ba da tonoso ndiri-ndiri kutsitsɛng kutsik Adakunom sak na bágwɔm nɛ bafi kukyem aton aza. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Adakunom nye anɔng kpaf ni ishim wu ifɛ́ ayɛ na ayɛ, fi i sɛ ishining ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso aTisa yit. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Nek kusot yit ayɛt wu, ni inɔɔk atsak yit ni wu, fi in di ki tsees yit ashon Adakunom ni iyɛ izining nɛ agap iyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Nek anɔng, in tsin ra awon ni yin, da nkap yin bi te gbɛrɛk nek izot fi in se ne nek iyin awo, mgbang e da ki bɛ́ yin ni itek.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awon nek bafɛ́ Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Nek anɔng, in sas akut aben ashon Adada, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />iwu fɛ́ bafɛ́ azanɛn nɛ azatse di sɛs iyerek bá. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />In ra awon fok ayɛt kudot itek wu, a ki nɔɔk yin agap abik ayɛt ayɛ yin, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />nɔng Anet-Isheshek bin te itis ayɛt ayɛ yin nek inɔɔk atsak yin. In ra awon fok, ni ibang te yin aney, nɔng ishim yin da te agap, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />nɔng i di sɛ yin agap ni ishɛrɛp banet Adakunom, nɔng i di rēn yin kuyikyik, ni kuzamang, ni kutsik ishim Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Nɔng i da rēn yin ishim aKristi fi i wat agap irēn, nɔng i da bin shining yin ni nkyɔrɔk fi in nes na Adakunom.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Won iwu fɛ́ a nyes kashon ni ikyɛng fi in ku risim yit, ni idɔng fi in yiring yit, kpaf ni kukyem wu fi ku se ni kutomong ayɛt yit, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />won na a sɛ ízɔk nate bafi ikuus nɛ na Anet-Isheshek aYeso, ni kuzam kuka sak ni kuya, ayɛ vit igang! Anɔng.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Moon yin ice ayɛt irɔm <optbreak /> Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Nek anɔng, ti nggon inyang nek aTisa, in ra awon ni yin fok ni i nye yin kusot fi ku se kpaf ni iyes fɛ́ ba ki nye yin ne. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ba ki sɛs yin ayɛt imen nhwyɛ ni iyit ice, nɛ akabɔk, nyes yin akabɔk ne bafidang ayɛt ishim. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Nye yin ngma ikyɛng fi i da nye yin nek imoon ice abik ayɛt kusot kukyang. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Iyit yet yit kurɔm kuzining, Kabik kazining. Kpaf tɛ fɛ́ ba ki yes yit sak ni ite iyɛ izining. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />ATisa me yet azining, inɔɔk atsak izining, abatisma azining. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Adakunom azining, Ada banet ngma kusum. Iwu yet kashon na akaangan, a se ni kutomong kaakɛ, a se ayɛt kaakyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Awɛt sak na kaakyɛ azining yit, mi sɛ itek, kpaf ti kunang fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek mi ku nɔk. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ba di fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;Ni izen fɛ́ a kin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">ngarak naton;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">a kin tsɛng gung na bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">fi iwu shan ni itsom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">a nɔɔk banet awe nnang zizɛɛt.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Abom 68:18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />(Akyɛ fi ifɛ̀ de, tonong ɛ, &lt;&lt;A ngarak naton,&gt;&gt; tit a kin tsang tik sak aben kaben. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Iwu ayɔng fɛ́ a kin tik sak aben e, iwu me yɔng fɛ́ a tɛ a ngarak sak azanɛn, nɔng ízɔk wu bin di shining katon nɛ kazatse.) <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Iwu fɛ́ a sak bakak na ba sot batom wu, a sak bakak na ba sot batan wu, a sak bakak na ba sot bafi ishara ifɛ̀ wu, a sak bakak na ba sot banek bafi ikuus wu nɛ bafi itees bà. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />A nye anɔng, nek ba di nye banet Adakunom nek ba di kutomong mok inok kurɔm Anet-Isheshek, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />ma ngma yit in sot yit bazining ayɛt inɔɔk atsak, ni irēn Arim Adakunom, ma in te yit gbagba, in sɛ yit kurasak isot fi ku tas kufɛ́ Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Na anɔng, in da won yit nggɔn nnon, nfi itiri aze na aza tɛ ashi fi kuwun nye ne, ni ikok nhwyɛ fi nzam-nzam itees ka ba nye ne, ni iboroso fɛ́ bafi kutsitsɛng mbɔɔs, ka ba nyes e. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Aza iras nggɔn in yɔng, won ni in sot yit bafi itaas atsak ayɛt ishim, won ni in rasak yit na kaakyi irén, ni in sot yit tɛ Anet-Isheshek, iwu fɛ́ a yet Ice kurɔm e. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ni wu fi kurɔm e ngma di moon, nkap irɔm kana monoso mo ne atsip itosop nkap e, ayɛt kutomong kutek fi nkap irɔm ras wu fi kurɔm kana nok mo ayɛt ishim.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusot tɛ bafi mgbey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Nek anɔng, in tsin fɛ̀ ane, in shim in bang ki tabak yin ni iyerek aTisa, i bi ti i ya yin kashon ni kusot ti Ícɛn-iduk di sosok awo, bafi kuyiring abap. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Nhwyi mi beseng irēn bá, ba mi ka ba kam ni kutset fi ku nes na Adakunom nek avit irēn fɛ́ ku se ayɛt bá, nek kukashalang ayɛ ba bɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Nek ba mi sot e, ba mi nɔɔk ice bá ni kusot ibeseng, nek iras in gbɛk-gbɛk nkyɔrɔk, ni ifoos ikɔk ibang ras e.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Awɛt iyin, anɔng fi itees Anet-Isheshek ki tonong yin awo! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Atsak e yet fok, iyin mi fok yin ifɛ̀ naton wu, ba mi ki tees yin kpaf na atsak fɛ́ a se ayɛt aYeso. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Ba kin ki tees yin ni iwobok yin nggɔn anɛn, ni kusot fi i tsang di se yin, kuyɔng fi ku beseng banet ni irèn ikɔk irɔm ni mbɔs; <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />nɔng i da sok yin nggɔn nfas ayɛt ayɛ yin; <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />nɔng i da te yin anet afas, ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ku nye na a sot ti iwu, ayɛt atsak, ni kusot kutabat nɛ ajɛrɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nek anɔng, kaakyɛ azining yin na a wobok mbɔɔs, na a taas afidang isot wu atsak, nek ngma yit, in yet yit nkap kurɔm kuzining. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />&lt;&lt;Ayɛt ibeseng iyɛ yin, i bi ra yin inɛn awo.&gt;&gt; I bi won yin kunom ni ku kpa ni tsin rēn beseng yin áyɛ awo, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />i bi nɔɔk yin aShetan kawat awo. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Won ayɔng fɛ́ a tsang yising, bi tɛ a di barang awo, tit na a ra kutomong kutek ni mbɔk wu, nɔng a da sɛ ikyɛng fɛ́ a di ki gbinding bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ̀ kudaam.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />I bi won yin ncɛɛt kpɛɛ ni in wuru na nu yin awo, tit kucɛɛt fi ku se gyat, fi ku da nok bakak ni izen ndaam, nɔng bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin di wes ato bin di sok ikikak. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />I bi beseng yin Kabik aJɛrɛ Adakunom iyɛ awo, nek iwu fɛ́ a yet nagang-ice-igwɔm Adakunom fi i se naton yin, fi i da ki bereng yin sak atuk ibisik. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Tun yin kaakyɛ kuri iyɛ ife, ni ifa, ni ibeseng iyɛ, ni kurēn, ni ibeseng iyerek nɛ akaakyɛ kuri anyas. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Sot yin kyang ni foos yin angmishish bafidang, fuut bafidang anɛn bá, kpaf tɛ fɛ́ Adakunom ki fuut yin ne ayɛt Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="ms">Nye yin kusot <optbreak /> ayɛt mgbey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Nek i mi sot yin nnon fɛ́ Adakunom shim, kuus yin nggɔn wu ni kusot yin. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Nye yin kusot ayɛt ishim, kpaf tɛ fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek ki tonong yit ishim, a nɔɔk ice wu nek iyit, ti inabak-akuce fɛ́ a bɛ́ nkɔn ntek sak na Adakunom.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Awɛt ba bi fok ikyi ikak ti kujang, kɛ kaakyi kuri nggɔn in gbɛk-gbɛk e, kɛ kuhwye nate yin awo, nek anɔng e se gyat na banet ajɛrɛ bafɛ́ Adakunom awo. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Ama anɔng, i bi cɛɛt yin kucɛɛt nsum kɛ kucɛɛt ishɔp kɛ aduk kuro awo, anɔng e se kpaf awo, akuce anɔng, nesek yin ifeng sak na Adakunom. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Rēn yin ane: vit afi kujang kɛ afi kutomong ku gbɛk-gbɛk kɛ afi kuhwye fɛ́ a se kpaf na anet iya nabannom ntong, fɛ́ a bi ya itekari ni igwɔm Anet-Isheshek ni ifɛ́ Adakunom. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Da akak bi ki wɔrɔk yin ni itang anu awo, nek kuri nkyɔrɔk yɔng fɛ́ kafa kawe Adakunom di tisik naton ágbakasak ánet. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nek anɔng, i bi moon yin ice ni iba awo.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Nek iyin kin tsang se yin na ahwyi, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng i mi sot yin mgbey ayɛt aTisa. Nye yin kusot ti nnon mgbey <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />(nek ikyɛng fi mgbey tes yet; nggɔn ntek, ni kusot kutabat nɛ atsak) <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />tsɛsɛk yin ikyɛng fi i da tɛrɛk aTisa iyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ikyi ikak bi ki moon yin ni ntomong abap ahwyi awo, akuce anɔng, tarak yin ina. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Nek iyet ikyɛng nsum, na ba cɛɛt nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba ras ni nɛt. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Awɛt ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ba tarak ni mgbey, se wɛshɛk, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />nek mgbey e na fi in tonoso kaakyɛ wɛshɛk. Nek anɔng fɛ́ ba di fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Shiming, ngɔn anet nda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">dorok ayɛt bafaben,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Anet-Isheshek da ta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">mgbey wu naton ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Nek anɔng, nɔ yin nhwyɛ yin, ni kusot fi i se yin ne, i bi sosok yin tɛ ashɔp awo tit tɛ batsitsɛng, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />ra yin kutomong gyat ne kaakyi kawat fi sɛ yin, nek nnom e yet nmaane. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Nek anɔng, i bi sot yin ishɔp awo tit rēn yin akyɛ de fɛ́ aTisa shim ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />I bi feng yin ni kutsit awo, nek anɔng e bɛ́s ni nggɔn ibeseng. Akuce anɔng, won Kabik Adakunom ka ki shining yin. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Cɛɛt yin na bafidang ayɛt abom itere, nɛ abom fɛ́ a nes na abik, tere yin aTisa na abom fɛ́ a nes na ayɛ yin. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Nesek yin Ada Adakunom ifeng nek kaakyi ikyɛng ni iyerek aYeso Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banyining nɛ Bamatek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Nabasa yin ace yin na bafidang, nek iratek fi i nesek yin Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Banyining, nabasa yin ace yin sak na bamatek yin ti i tsin nye yin aTisa ne. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Nek amatek wu a yet ice abining, kyɔn tɛ Anet-Isheshek di yet ice bafi ikuus, kurɔm wu, fi iwu wu a yet Anet-Isheshek e. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Kyɔn tɛ bafi ikuus di nasap ice na Anet-Isheshek, anɔng wu banyining ba di nasap ace bá na bamatek bá na kaakyi irèn.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Bamatek, tonoso yin banyining yin ishim, kyɔn tɛ Anet-Isheshek di tonong bafi ikuus ne. A nɔɔk ice wu nek iba <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />nɔng a ka ba te mo jɛrɛ, a ka ba kusu ni ikusu ashi ni ifi ifɛ̀. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />A nye anɔng, nɔng a da bin nabak ice wu ne, bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba nɛp, vit karìk kɛ ikɔɔt, kɛ ibeseng ikak ayi, tit banet ajɛrɛ vit ibeseng. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Kpaf anɔng fi i se gyat bamatek na ba shim banyining bá ti nrɔm bá. Ngma anet fɛ́ a shim abining wu, a tsin shim ice wu yɔng. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Nek vit anet fɛ́ a ki mang rawu kurɔm wu, tit na nesek iko nayak na nye iko, kyɔn tɛ Anet-Isheshek di nye na bafi ikuus wu, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />nek ngma yit in yet yit nkap irɔm wu. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Nek anɔng, anet da won ada wu ni nggɔ wu, na kana moon na abining wu, na bafaa me sot kurɔm kuzining.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Imɛsɛng 2:24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Ifɛ̀ deng yet ifi inɛt makiyi awɛt imi cɛɛt naton Anet-Isheshek nɛ bafi ikuus. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ngma na anɔng, won kaakyɛ azining yin na a shim abining wu tɛ a da shim ice wu, na abining e nesek amatek wu iratek.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Nnon nɛ bada bá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Nnon, foos yin ifɛ̀ bada ni binggɔ yin na Adakunom, nek anɔng e se gyat. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Ti i di se ni ijɛk fok, &lt;&lt;Nɔk ada ni nggɔ ngɔn iratek.&gt;&gt; Nek ide yet agbat ifɛ̀ fɛ́ ba moon ni kushi. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />Ki i nɔɔk yin bada ni binggɔ yin, &lt;&lt;i da sɛ yin awɛng, i da sɛ yin nkɔs dot azatse.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Bada, i bi sas yin nnon yin kafa kawe awo; akuce anɔng, ka ba ta yin ni itees, ni itabak aTisa.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basam nɛ Bátékari bá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Basam, foos yin ifɛ̀, ni nnyim bátékari yin bafɛ́ azatse. Nye yin anɔng na atsak iyɛ kyɔn ti i tsin nye yin Anet-Isheshek ne. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />I bi nyes yin itek na yisi bá kyɛk mok i di tsɛt itere bá awo, tit tɛ basam Anet-Isheshek fɛ́ ba se ni ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim ni iyɛ izining. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Ras yin kutomong ni iyɛ izining kyɔn ti i tsin ras yin aTisa ne, da anet awo, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />nek i rēn yin fok aTisa bi nɔɔk kaangan izang wu, na kaakyi kutomong kutek fɛ́ a ra, ke na a yet asam kɛ awashak anet ayi.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Bátékari, ras yin basam yin anɔng bà. I bi ka ba tes yin nnyim awo, nek i rēn yin fok, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a yet Atekari bá, nɛ afiin, a se azanɛn, a bi itsarang ishim ice awo.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ares itsom afɛ́ <optbreak /> Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ni gang e, te yin gbagba ayɛt aTisa nɛ ayɛt kukyem wu fi ku se makiyi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Te yin ngma ares itsom Adakunom, nɔng i da bin kyem i nyeseng yin gak ni itɛnɛsɛ narɔk aShetan. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Nek ifa yit se ni inam na nasok awo tit na bágwɔm, nɛ bafi kukyem, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ya igwɔm azatse ahwyi kang, nɛ aduk abik fɛ́ a se naton aza. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Nek anɔng, te yin ngma ares itsom Adakunom, nɔng atuk fi imaan inom bi bɛ́, i bi kyem i nyeseng yin gak, ama fi i mi gang yin kaakyɛ, ni nyeseng yin gak.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Nek anɔng, nyeseng yin gak! Te yin atsak tɛ kudun fɛ́ ba rosom nyɛng na awit, ni won yin kusot atsak ni kusot akpara-gwɔm yin, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />won inye fi i mi kana nye nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek fi ibɛ́s ni kusot kukyang, ni isot akpatak yin. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ama anɔng, won inɔɔk atsak yin ni isot kugɛ, fi i di ki tɛnɛsɛ yin abelel afet amaan e. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Sok yin abong kutsɔm fɛ́ a yet isheshek yin nɛ awal abik fɛ́ a yet Ifɛ́ Adakunom. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Na kaakyɛ awon, ras yin awon kaakyi izen ayɛt abik. Ni kuyiring anɔng, nɔ yin nhwyɛ yin, ya yin kashon na awon nek bafɛ́ atsak. <figure style="fig" alt="The armor of God" file="WA04009b.tif" size="col" loc="EPH 6:18" copy="Wade Imges" ref="6:10-18">Ares itsom afɛ́ Adakunom</figure><verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Di ras yin awon kaakyi izen, nɔng ngma izen fi in tarak kanu, in da sɛ ikyɛng ifɛ̀, nɔng in da se vit nnyim ayɛt ishara ikyɛng fi i kin se ni nɛt ayɛt ifɛ̀ itek, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />fi imi yet anet icɛɛt, fi in di se ni nyang nek ide. Ras yin awon nɔng in da taas ide vit nnyim, ni in taas ide gyat.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ite ashow igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Icɛk iyɛ aTikikus, asam Adakunom afɛ́ atsak, da ki tak yin kaakyi ikyɛng nɔng i da rēn yin anɛ fi in di se ni ikyɛng fi in se ne. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Imi tsin ku tom nek anɔng, nɔng i da bin rēn yin kusot yit, na a ki barang yin mo agap ni iyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ábaruneng, won kukyang, na atsak, ni ishim fi ines na Adakunom, Ada aTisa aYeso Kristi, ni i sot gung ni yin. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Won itek Adakunom ni isot ifɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba shim aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, ni ishim fi i se vit igang.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>